        "title": "Pui jianloumei khuan njangmei",
        "credits": {
          "translator": null,
          "editor": null
        },
        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Pui jian loumei khuan njangmmei,",
            "Ai #-5 musui puinung makge;",
            "Nangnah guai ta lou du sini,",
            "Kalum loumei guai mu ri o.",
            "",
            "Chorus:",
            "Jaujian lou o ai #-5 huai e,",
            "Kadang khou tei ai #-5 bamni;",
            "Akhang kalum loumei khuan #-5,",
            "Mpuan kumma akhou liu guang.",
            "",
            "2. Kakhuan #-5 neila loumei tei,",
            "Ai #-5 musui puinung makge;",
            "Jianmei guaita pat lou sini,",
            "Thai tang makge apui ram jian.",
            "",
            "3. Bu le nei le tingkum man ni,",
            "Thuanpui tuang guaituai dat lakkhe;",
            "Apui apu njian liangmmei,",
            "Akhang tak maknga kalum e.",
            "",
            "4. Raguang jaujian thuan kariu o,",
            "Mei guai na#-5 kariu lana;",
            "Akhang kalum loumei pan #-5,",
            "Gaipui ram khou bam kariuni.",
            "",
            "5. Hei kandih hei akai ram e,",
            "Jangsi kadipui kandih e;",
            "Bam khuan tho de ananun guai,",
            "Mulou lak ge nangniu guai ta."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
